https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\"Can accept any resource that extends [...]\" is never a necessary remark and it's implied by the property's type. If there was any exception to the norm, that's what should be mentioned.\n\nThe 4 trailing periods, \"....\", aren't suitable either. The class reference would usually say \"etc.\" in this case.","created_at":"2026-05-24T19:08:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-24T19:46:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119536#discussion_r3295163878","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119536","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3295163878"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119536#discussion_r3295163878"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119536"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3295163878/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":88,"original_line":88,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":27,"position":27,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3295170756","pull_request_review_id":4353268841,"id":3295170756,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7EaFDE","diff_hunk":"@@ -83,7 +85,8 @@\n \t\t\tThe region of the atlas texture to display. [member region_enabled] must be [code]true[/code].\n \t\t</member>\n \t\t<member name=\"texture\" type=\"Texture2D\" setter=\"set_texture\" getter=\"get_texture\">\n-\t\t\t[Texture2D] object to draw.\n+\t\t\tThe [Texture2D] resource to draw. Can accept any resource that extends [Texture2D], including [ImageTexture], [AtlasTexture], and [CompressedTexture2D]....\n+\t\t\tSetting to [code]null[/code] will hide the sprite without removing the node.","path":"doc/classes/Sprite2D.xml","commit_id":"13f89c89a5a6af9fe85906da7c2d27aaa382fe25","original_commit_id":"13f89c89a5a6af9fe85906da7c2d27aaa382fe25","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This may be the most useful sentence in the PR, but it also is quite misleading. \"_hide_\" has a very strong meaning in the context of anything inheriting CanvasItem (including Sprite2D). It implies the `visible` is set to `false` which is not the case here.\n\nThere's also absolutely no need to say \"without removing the node\" because it's not something to be expected. Changing a node's property doesn't remove the node. It's common, normal, it doesn't need to be mentioned.","created_at":"2026-05-24T19:14:29Z","updated_at":"2026-05-24T19:46:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119536#discussion_r3295170756","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119536","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3295170756"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godoten